{"id":"ca832ed6bc22f728","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-df-measure.md","title":"Measure","display":"df-measure — Measure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-measure","aliases":["58-df-measure"],"display":"df-measure — Measure","depends_on":["[[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-measure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-measure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-measure — Measure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,\\mathcal{F})\">\\((X,\\mathcal{F})\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>-algebra space, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu:\\mathcal{F}\\to[0,\\infty]\">\\(\\mu:\\mathcal{F}\\to[0,\\infty]\\)</span> (function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}\">\\(\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}\\)</span> (sigma-algebra predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Measure}_S\\)</span> (measure predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}measure} \\vdash \\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal F,X)\\land\\mu:\\mathcal F\\to[0,\\infty]\\land\\mu(\\varnothing)=0\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal F^\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\\forall i,j\\in\\omega\\;(i\\neq j\\to A_i\\cap A_j=\\varnothing)\\to\\mu\\bigl(\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}A_n\\bigr)=\\sum_{n\\in\\omega}\\mu(A_n)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}measure} \\vdash \\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal F,X)\\land\\mu:\\mathcal F\\to[0,\\infty]\\land\\mu(\\varnothing)=0\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal F^\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\\forall i,j\\in\\omega\\;(i\\neq j\\to A_i\\cap A_j=\\varnothing)\\to\\mu\\bigl(\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}A_n\\bigr)=\\sum_{n\\in\\omega}\\mu(A_n)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>-有限测度：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists A\\in\\mathcal F^\\omega\\;(X=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}A_n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\mu(A_n)&lt;\\infty)\">\\(\\exists A\\in\\mathcal F^\\omega\\;(X=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}A_n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\mu(A_n)&lt;\\infty)\\)</span></li>\n<li>概率测度：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu(X) = 1\">\\(\\mu(X) = 1\\)</span></li>\n<li>完备测度：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A \\subseteq B \\in \\mathcal{F} \\;\\land\\; \\mu(B) = 0 \\;\\to\\; A \\in \\mathcal{F}\">\\(A \\subseteq B \\in \\mathcal{F} \\;\\land\\; \\mu(B) = 0 \\;\\to\\; A \\in \\mathcal{F}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(X,\\mathcal{F})$ ($\\sigma$-algebra space, see [[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mu:\\mathcal{F}\\to[0,\\infty]$ (function, see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}$ (sigma-algebra predicate, see [[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(X,\\mathcal{F})","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu:\\mathcal{F}\\to[0,\\infty]","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Measure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}measure} \\vdash \\mathrm{Measure}_